# The POS UI needs no build-time configuration: it calls /api/v1 on its own origin, and the
# Express app in backend/ serves the built files.
#
# For `npm run dev`, the Vite proxy targets http://localhost:5000. To point it elsewhere,
# pass it in the shell (Vite does not read plain variables from .env):
#   POS_API_TARGET=http://localhost:5055 npm run dev
